{"detail": {"templateUuid": "ebbb1eee49a54442ba0baa9bbcd5f24d", "projectUuid": "135fdb797a1743c790f8194baca42ccd", "name": "2.5初体验 三个怪家伙狂想曲丨欢乐超现实动画音乐MV", "description": "《三个怪家伙狂想曲》是一支欢乐超现实动画音乐MV。三个性格与体型截然不同的怪家伙，从一间红色天鹅绒卧室出发，穿过弯曲走廊、倒走时钟大厅、奇幻街道与复古剧场，让原本安静的世界逐渐跟随音乐摇摆、弹跳与旋转。作品将英文歌词转化为角色动作、空间变化、镜头运动和立体文字，以红、蓝、金为核心视觉语言，构建出统一而充满活力的奇想舞台。项目从概念、音乐、歌词、角色、场景、分镜到视频生成与后期剪辑完整推进，尝试探索AI动画音乐MV的系统化创作流程。\n作品想表达的是：不必按照同一种方式前进，每个“不合常规”的人，也能找到属于自己的节拍。", "coverUrl": "/assets/e2aca262dc951e12.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/605c133411b74a8b8092650ab2a83808/e6e893f3bff9012f81d6f68c615eef57675e8fbc.mp4", "snapshotId": 34129, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 1249552, "ownerUuid": "605c133411b74a8b8092650ab2a83808", "avatar": "/assets/76937f0200c94087.webp", "nickname": "像素农夫DESIGN", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 149, "tags": [{"id": 1204, "code": "mv", "tagLabel": "MV", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1204/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1701, "code": "sd25", "tagLabel": "Seedance 2.5", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1701/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 8, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "sessionSnapshots": [{"sessionId": "72e0385f-f051-420c-8cb1-83e9aa67925e", "name": "反推Midjourney风格提示词", "createdAtMs": 1785814301111, "shareId": "qR2uDd2O4w", "lastMessageId": "992003339330805772"}], "shareIds": ["qR2uDd2O4w"], "createAt": "2026年08月06日 23:14", "updateAt": "2026年08月10日 19:25", "publishAt": "2026年08月07日 11:57", "playCount": 135, "viewCreationProcessCount": 80, "copyCanvasCount": 15, "shareCount": 1, "snaps